they need what they like how you can  help them and from there you'll get the  information you need to be able to  create your business plan the danger  doing it the other way is your business  plan will be you know useless and  extinct you know the day you actually  start going on marketing the product as  you launch your business your business  plan is going to change you're going to  get new opportunities customers will  come with the new problems your  marketing strategy will change your  expenses might change  little bit so your business plan will  constantly have to change a little bit  but it's best if you can to have a good  concept from the beginning built around  what you know will sell and what  customers want so my number one thing if  you're starting the business is just go  start talking to customers find out the  problems build the solution around their  needs and then once you've got a sense  of what their challenges are and you  will to get a couple orders ideally  coming in you can create your business  plan on how you're going to create this  no company out of this you know idea and  be able to grow and expand to other  companies build a team build your  facilities if you need to continue to  grow the business so hopefully that  helps Anthony those are you watching if  you liked the video please give it a  thumbs up I always love seeing those  come in and if you have a thought for  Anthony or you have a question I'd love  the hero deform leave a comment  underneath the video so thank you and  you'll see you on the next episode  you
 

